@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/favoris
@clientToken = <client-jwt>

### Favoris - Toggle favoris
POST {{baseUrl}}/1/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Favoris - List favoris
GET {{baseUrl}}?page=0&size=12
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Favoris - List favoris ids
GET {{baseUrl}}/ids
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Favoris - Check annonce favoris
GET {{baseUrl}}/1/check
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
